# Generated slide renders from `marp deck.md ...` — the source of truth is
# deck.md. PDF and PPTX are treated as ephemeral outputs (regenerable in
# seconds); the HTML render IS tracked so it can be opened directly from a
# clone or served via GitHub Pages without requiring the Marp CLI on the
# reader's machine. Re-run `marp deck.md --html -o deck.html` after every
# deck.md change and commit both together to keep them in sync.
*.pdf
*.pptx
